  "description": "Fast Forward Geo, Fast Forward Design – the Shave FF knows only one direction. Aerodynamically optimised down to the smallest detail, it sets the new benchmark for all-in-one bikes in the wind tunnel. An uncompromisingly progressive geometry, the well thought-out frame concept and specially developed components reinforce this claim. The shape follows the function and the function follows your goal: Being faster than everyone else. Highlights: • Aero frame design – faster than faster • Carbon cockpit – aero shape with modern dimensions • Aero carbon seat post – zero offset for maximum efficiency • 35 mm tyre clearance – more room for demanding routes • Integrated power meter – power measurement in real time • UDH derailleur hanger – prepared for singlespeed shifting The Shave FF Force AXS is equipped with the electronic SRAM Force AXS groupset with 2x12 gears and integrated power meter. Lightweight Rose RC55 high-profile carbon wheels with 28 mm Schwalbe Pro One Aero tyres provide efficiency and power savings. The sleek Selle Italia SLR Advan saddle puts the final stamp on the look and the performance. ¹ approx. 7.0 kg, may vary by up to +/- 5 % due to manufacturing tolerances, weight for frame colour silver, size M, without pedals. For individual height adjustments, 20 mm spacers are fitted under the cockpit as standard. The illustrations show the Shave without spacers with a shortened steerer tube.",
